  "description": "A movie discussion club that somehow turned into a support group for people with unrequited crushes. But the club president, Ban Ha-Ri, is a cold-hearted realist who thinks romance is a waste of time. One day, just as the club is on the verge of disbanding, a new member joins as if by a miracle… but could it be that “first love” who turned my world upside down four years ago and then ran away?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
